# Never line-ending-convert binaries. With core.autocrlf on Windows, git
# guessed the QA PDF was text and would have rewritten LF to CRLF inside its
# compressed streams on checkout, leaving a file no reader can open.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
